INFO 2026-04-20 15:48:46,942 accounts.api_io [request_id=4A1D08A3-DD3E-42DC-BEAB-77F00621E0BD] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=6 bytes=2114 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMThUMDc6NDE6NTguODU3NTM1KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMjQ0In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "4e36c401-90c2-4b80-a26a-4a1e163ce7a7", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你会做什么", "client_message_id": "18a07681-1a41-4066-891c-a16715a9c4c0", "server_message_id": "f6d018b5-c383-4ebb-b235-e89ebb246c44", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T07:41:50.233000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T07:41:50.239784+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "4e36c401-90c2-4b80-a26a-4a1e163ce7a7", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我是 **Spark 健康助手**，可以为您提供以下帮助：\n\n---\n\n## 核心能力\n\n| 类别 | 具体服务 |\n|:---|:---|\n| **症状评估** | 分析不适症状，判断紧急程度，建议就医时机 |\n| **报告解读** | 解释检查报告、化验单中的关键指标 |\n| **用药指导** | 药物作用、用法、注意事项、相互作用提醒 |\n| **慢病管理** | 高血压、糖尿病、血脂异常等的日常监测与生活方式建议 |\n| **健康建议** | 饮食、运动、睡眠、压力管理等可执行方案 |\n| **就医指引** | 根据症状推荐科室，解释诊疗流程 |\n\n---\n\n## 我能看到的\n\n- 您有一条 **2026年4月18日** 的检查报告记录（如需解读，请提供具体内容）\n\n---\n\n## 现在可以帮您\n\n1. **解读这份4月18日的检查报告** — 请上传或描述报告内容\n2. **咨询具体症状或健康问题**\n3. **制定健康管理计划**\n\n**您需要什么帮助？**", "client_message_id": "e386fe7e-06be-4ff2-a0a9-a7d15afa8258", "server_message_id": "8ca15929-b10b-426c-be91-cdfa01d39ffb", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T07:41:58.920000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T07:41:58.857535+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
