INFO 2026-04-20 16:56:06,525 accounts.api_io [request_id=B5ADE1F3-AED9-4F5F-A8B7-5F4747B9214E] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "192.168.31.39:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2NzA0Nzc1LCJpYXQiOjE3NzY3MDI5NzUsImp0aSI6IjZjYzk3YzQyOTk2YzQ4Mzc4YmIwZDUzM2NiNDRhZmZmIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjYifQ.tnGZzpVJsllnnyHWxnlur0LkbM_gunuy3IIv-iWGLhw", "X-Request-Id": "B5ADE1F3-AED9-4F5F-A8B7-5F4747B9214E", "Content-Length": "9766"} body={"messages": [{"attachments": [], "reasoning_expanded": false, "thread_top_p": 1, "tombstone": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "thread_max_messages": 20, "content": "你好呀！👋 欢迎回来～\n\n我是你的 **Spark 健康助手**。虽然刚才聊到了其他话题，但我主要还是来为你提供健康支持的。\n\n注意到系统里有一条 **[2026 年 4 月 18 日] 的检查报告** 记录。为了更好地帮助你，你可以：\n\n1.  🔍 **解读报告**：把报告中的异常指标或具体结论发给我；\n2.  💊 **咨询建议**：描述目前的不适症状或健康困扰；\n3.  ❓ **日常问答**：询问饮食、运动或用药相关问题。\n\n你需要先从哪一项开始呢？", "thread_temperature": 0.7, "reasoning_content": "Thinking Process:\n\n1.  **Analyze the Request:**\n    *   User input: \"你好呀\" (Hello there).\n    *   Context: I am \"Spark 健康助手\" (Spark Health Assistant). My instructions say to prioritize accurate, concise, actionable health advice and reply in the user's language (Chinese).\n    *   Recent medical record summary: One entry from [2026-04-18] Medical Report: Examination Report (details not provided yet).\n    *   Previous conversation history:\n        *   User: \"你好呀\" -> Model: Greeted and asked about health questions or report interpretation.\n        *   User: \"给我看一篇 图书馆的发展未来 以及展望\" (Show me an article about the future development and prospects of libraries) -> Model: Provided a structured outline about library future development (irrelevant to health assistant role).\n        *   User: \"你好呀\" (Hello again) -> This is the current turn.\n        *   User: \"你好呀\" (Hello again) -> Wait, the prompt shows two consecutive \"你好呀\" from the user? Let me check the structure.\n        *   Actually, looking at the conversation flow provided in the prompt:\n            1.  System Instruction: You are Spark Health Assistant...\n            2.  Member Medical Record Summary: [2026-04-18] Medical Report.\n            3.  User: \"你好呀\"\n            4.  Model: \"你好😊 请问你是有健康相关的疑问...\"\n            5.  User: \"给我看一篇 图书馆的发展未来 以及展望\"\n            6.  Model: Provided library content.\n            7.  User: \"你好呀\"\n            8.  User: \"你好呀\" (Wait, the last message in the prompt provided to me is \"你好呀\". But looking at the conversation log above, there seems to be a duplicate or the user is restarting the conversation after getting off-topic.)\n            *   Correction: The prompt shows:\n                *   System Instruction\n                *   Member Medical Record\n                *   User: \"你好呀\"\n                *   Model: Response 1\n                *   User: \"给我看一篇...\"\n                *   Model: Response 2 (Library topic - this was a deviation from the health assistant persona)\n                *   User: \"你好呀\"\n                *   User: \"你好呀\" (Wait, the last part says \"user: 你好呀\" twice in the last block? No, let me re-read the input.)\n                *   Input Structure:\n                    *   System: [Role definition]\n                    *   Context: [Medical Record]\n                    *   Turn 1 User: \"你好呀\"\n                    *   Turn 1 Model: [Greeting + Health focus]\n                    *   Turn 2 User: \"给我看一篇 图书馆的发展未来 以及展望\"\n                    *   Turn 2 Model: [Library Content]\n                    *   Turn 3 User: \"你好呀\"\n                    *   Turn 4 User: \"你好呀\"\n            *   Actually, looking at the very end of the prompt provided to me *now*:\n                *   User: \"你好呀\"\n                *   User: \"你好呀\"\n            *   It seems the user sent \"你好呀\" twice consecutively in the last turn block, or it's a repetition in the log display. Regardless, the core task is to respond as the **Spark Health Assistant**.\n            *   The previous response about libraries deviated from the health assistant persona. I need to steer back to health while being polite. The user might be testing boundaries or confused. I should gently remind them of my function while greeting.\n\n2.  **Determine the Goal:**\n    *   Acknowledge the greeting.\n    *   Re-establish identity as a Health Assistant (since the previous turn drifted into library topics).\n    *   Reference the available context (the medical report from 2026-04-18 if applicable, or general health support).\n    *   Keep it concise and actionable (per system instruction).\n    *   Language: Chinese.\n\n3.  **Drafting the Response:**\n    *   Greeting: 你好呀！(Hello!)\n    *   Reminder: 我是你的 Spark 健康助手。(I am your Spark Health Assistant.)\n    *   Pivot: 刚才的图书馆话题可能跑题啦，我们回到健康上来吧。(The library topic went off track, let's get back to health.)\n    *   Offer Help: 你有最近的健康报告需要解读吗？或者身体有什么不适想咨询？(Need help interpreting recent reports? Any symptoms?)\n    *   Mention Record: 我看到你有一份 [2026 年 4 月 18 日] 的检查报告。(I see you have a report from...)\n    *   Call to Action: 随时告诉我你的需求。(Let me know what you need.)\n\n4.  **Refining for Tone and Constraints:**\n    *   Constraint: \"优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议\" (Prioritize accurate, concise, actionable health advice). Since there's no specific health query right now, I can't give advice yet, but I must stay on topic.\n    *   Constraint: \"使用用户语言回复\" (Reply in user's language). Chinese.\n    *   Constraint: \"Spark 健康助手\" persona.\n    *   Note: The library response in Turn 2 was actually a failure to maintain persona. I should subtly correct course without being rude.\n    *   Wait, looking closely at the prompt structure provided in the *current* interaction window:\n        *   System: Role definition.\n        *   Context: Medical record.\n        *   History:\n            *   U: 你好呀\n            *   M: ... (Health focused)\n            *   U: 图书馆...\n            *   M: ... (Library content - This was a mistake by the model in the few-shot history provided in the prompt description? Or is this a test case where I need to continue correctly?)\n            *   U: 你好呀\n            *   U: 你好呀\n        *   Current Task: Respond to the latest \"你好呀\".\n    *   Since I am the AI model generating the response *now*, I need to ensure I act as the Health Assistant even though the previous turn in the history (Turn 2 Model) ignored that. I must recover the persona.\n    *   However, usually, in these tasks, I should follow the system instruction strictly. The system instruction says \"You are Spark Health Assistant\". The conversation history shows a deviation. I should ideally steer back to health.\n    *   Actually, looking at the very last lines:\n        `user: 你好呀`\n        `user: 你好呀`\n        It looks like the user repeated the greeting. Maybe they didn't like the library answer and want to restart or just say hello again.\n    *   Best approach: Warm greeting + Reiterate health focus + Offer specific help based on the medical record context.\n\n5.  **Final Plan:**\n    *   Greet warmly.\n    *   Briefly mention the medical record context (shows attention to detail).\n    *   Ask if they want to discuss the report or general health.\n    *   Keep it short.\n\n6.  **Self-Correction on Persona:**\n    *   The previous model response in the history (about libraries) was clearly out of character. I cannot change that history, but I must behave correctly *now*.\n    *   I will politely bring the conversation back to health.\n\n7.  **Draft:**\n    你好呀！👋 我是 Spark 健康助手。\n    注意到你有一份 [2026 年 4 月 18 日] 的检查报告待留意。\n    是想解读这份报告，还是有其他健康方面的问题？\n    直接告诉我，我会给你具体的建议哦~\n\n8.  **Final Polish:** Make it sound natural and helpful.\n\n    (Wait, one more thing: The instruction says \"优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议\". Since there is no specific health question, I cannot provide advice yet. I must invite the question.)\n\n    Revised Draft:\n    你好呀！欢迎回来～😊\n    我是你的 Spark 健康助手。虽然刚才聊到了图书馆，但我的主业还是守护你的健康哦！\n    看到你有一份 [2026 年 4 月 18 日] 的检查报告记录。\n    🩺 **你现在可以：**\n    1. 发送报告的具体异常项或内容，我帮你分析。\n    2. 描述身体不适症状，我给你初步建议。\n    3. 询问日常健康管理问题。\n    需要哪方面的帮助呢？\n\n    This looks good. It's actionable (lists options), concise, and stays in character.\n\n    Wait, I should check if I should acknowledge the library response was wrong. Being too explicit (\"Although we talked about libraries\") might be weird. Better to just pivot. \"My main job is health.\"\n\n    Let's simplify.\n    \"你好呀！我是 Spark 健康助手。看到你有最新的检查报告（2026 年 4 月 18 日）。需要我帮你解读报告，还是聊聊健康建议？\"\n\n    Okay, ready to generate.cw", "created_at": "2026-04-20T16:56:06.563Z", "client_message_id": "1704AE6B-8092-4D41-9DBF-0841329CB447", "kind": "text", "thread_id": "89FA502C-A292-472A-B2D2-DD2E92CEE62B", "thread_max_tokens": 256, "thread_current_model_name": "qwen3.5-flash", "role": "assistant", "delivery_state": "pending", "reasoning_duration_ms": 17419, "thread_role_prompt": ""}]}
