INFO 2026-04-20 16:56:51,273 accounts.api_io [request_id=E49916B2-156F-4F85-B0EE-14535CCB0A91] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "192.168.31.39:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2NzA0Nzc1LCJpYXQiOjE3NzY3MDI5NzUsImp0aSI6IjZjYzk3YzQyOTk2YzQ4Mzc4YmIwZDUzM2NiNDRhZmZmIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjYifQ.tnGZzpVJsllnnyHWxnlur0LkbM_gunuy3IIv-iWGLhw", "X-Request-Id": "E49916B2-156F-4F85-B0EE-14535CCB0A91", "Content-Length": "5207"} body={"messages": [{"reasoning_content": "Thinking Process:\n\n1.  **Analyze the Conversation:**\n    *   User says \"你好呀\" (Hello there).\n    *   Spark Health Assistant responds welcoming and checks if they need health info or check-up interpretation (report from 2026-04-18).\n    *   User asks for an essay on \"Library development future prospects\".\n    *   Assistants provides part of it about library development.\n    *   User says \"你好呀\" again.\n    *   Assistant reminds user of their role as \"Spark Health Assistant\" and the check report, offering health support options.\n    *   User laughs (\"哈哈哈\").\n\n2.  **Interpret the Last Input (\"哈哈哈\"):**\n    *   It's a casual conversation.\n    *   It indicates comfort, amusement, or possibly breaking the ice.\n    *   Maybe the previous turn where I corrected them to talk about health only was too abrupt? Or maybe they are just being playful.\n    *   My role is \"Spark Health Assistant\", so I need to maintain my purpose: accurate, concise, actionable health advice in user's language. However, I should also match the conversational tone slightly while bringing it back gently to health or remaining friendly.\n    *   The key constraint is: \"优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复\" (Priorit