INFO 2026-04-20 23:49:09,101 accounts.api_io [request_id=2A0CCAE1-015D-4040-A56E-45D5655A784D] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "192.168.31.39:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2NzMwMDYzLCJpYXQiOjE3NzY3MjgyNjMsImp0aSI6IjRjZTg4ZWNiMWEwOTQ4ZjNhNWU3ODA2ZWU0ZTk3YTcwIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjYifQ.JF0NxPGALeyBbH7h5OEsVk5UXMxwUW3ilW-ga5FiT3s", "X-Request-Id": "2A0CCAE1-015D-4040-A56E-45D5655A784D", "Content-Length": "8841"} body={"messages": [{"thread_role_prompt": "", "kind": "text", "reasoning_content": "Thinking Process:\n\n1.  **Analyze the Request:**\n    *   User wants a \"Prescription File Structured\" (处方档案 结构化).\n    *   Context: Previous interactions involved an invoice/receipt from Suzhou Jiulong Hospital (2026-04-18) containing two medicines: Prednisone Tablets (泼尼松片) and Levocetirizine Oral Solution (左西替利嗪口服溶液), with some insurance details. The user suspected hives (urticaria).\n    *   Goal: Create a structured, easy-to-read, actionable prescription record based on the available information from the invoice/image OCR.\n    *   Constraint: I am an AI health assistant, cannot call external tools to store data, but can present structured text/data formats that the user can save or use.\n\n2.  **Review Available Data:**\n    *   **Date:** 2026-04-18\n    *   **Hospital:** 苏州九龙医院股份有限公司 (Suzhou Jiulong Hospital)\n    *   **Patient Name:** 赵道凯 (Zhao Daokai)\n    *   **Insurance:** 职工基本医疗保险 (Employee Basic Medical Insurance)\n    *   **Total Cost:** ¥168.52\n    *   **Medications:**\n        1.  甲泼尼龙片（信谊）？Wait, looking at OCR text: \"予發尼松片（信隆團婴 松片（信谊）\". This looks like \"甲泼尼龙片\" or \"泼尼松片\". Later in my previous response I said \"泼尼松片\". Let's re-examine the OCR text carefully.\n            *   OCR Text: \"予發尼松片（信隆團婴 松片（信谊）\" -> This is garbled. Usually \"Prednisone\" is 泼尼松。\"Methylprednisolone\" is 甲泼尼龙。Given the context of hives and common prescriptions, it's likely 泼尼松片 (Prednisone Tablets). In my previous turn, I identified it as 泼尼松片。I should stick to that unless new info contradicts. Actually, looking closely at \"予發尼松片\", it might be \"甲泼尼龙片\" but OCR error made it \"予發\". However, previously the user accepted \"泼尼松片\". I will standardize to the most likely generic name found in the text snippet \"松片（信谊）\". Common brand \"信谊\" often makes 复方甘草片，but also steroids. Let's assume \"泼尼松片\" as per previous turn consistency, but note the uncertainty if needed. Actually, looking at the price ¥168.52 for two items together? Or one item? The text says \"医疗服务*医疗服务乳星予發尼松片... 乾包 数導 0.52 税额... 其他 谊）溶液（平可宁）... 左西替利嗪口服溶液... 168.00\". It seems the total is 168.52.\n            *   Item 1: 激素类 (Steroid) - Likely 泼尼松片 (Prednisone) or similar. Price/Tax info is messy.\n            *   Item 2: 左西替利嗪口服溶液 (Levocetirizine Oral Solution / Pingkening). Price 168.00 mentioned near it.\n            *   Wait, the OCR is very noisy. \"医疗服务*左西替利嗪口服 左西替利嗪口服溶液（平可宁）168.00\".\n            *   Okay, I need to structure this clearly despite the OCR noise. I will list the clear parts and mark uncertain dosage (since invoice doesn't show quantity/dosage per pill, just total cost).\n    *   **Diagnosis (Inferred):** Acute Urticaria (急性荨麻疹) based on meds and rash photo description.\n\n3.  **Determine Structure:**\n    A good structured prescription file should include:\n    *   Header (Patient Info, Date, Hospital)\n    *   Medication List (Name, Type, Usage, Warnings)\n    *   Diagnosis/Condition\n    *   Payment Info (Optional but useful for reimbursement records)\n    *   Actionable Notes (Next steps)\n\n    Format: Markdown table or JSON-like structure for \"structured\" feel. Since the user asked for \"Structured\", a clean Markdown layout is best for readability and copying.\n\n4.  **Drafting Content:**\n    *   **Title:** 处方档案 (Prescription Record)\n    *   **Basic Info:** Patient, Date, Hospital, Doctor (Unknown), Dept (Outpatient/门诊).\n    *   **Diagnosis:** 急性荨麻疹 (Acute Urticaria) - inferred.\n    *   **Medication List:**\n        *   Med 1: 左西替利嗪口服溶液 (Ping Ke Ning). Type: Antihistamine.\n        *   Med 2: 泼尼松片 (Prednisone Tablets) - based on OCR \"松片（信谊）\". Type: Corticosteroid.\n    *   **Dosage:** Not explicitly clear on invoice (invoice shows total amount), so I must advise checking the physical box/prescription slip for specific frequency/dose.\n    *   **Payment:** Total 168.52 CNY. Insurance covered part.\n    *   **Safety:** Steroid tapering, antihistamine drowsiness.\n\n5.  **Refining Output:**\n    *   Keep it concise.\n    *   Highlight warnings (especially steroid use).\n    *   Use clear sections.\n    *   Remind user that specific dosage needs confirmation from the original prescription paper (as invoices often lack detailed dosage instructions).\n\n6.  **Self-Correction/Safety Check:**\n    *   Did I hallucinate the drug name? The OCR says \"松片（信谊）\". Could be \"甲泼尼龙\" or \"泼尼松\". Given \"尿囊素\" no... Given common urolithiasis treatment? No, it's hives. For acute severe hives, Prednisone (泼尼松) or Methylprednisolone (甲泼尼龙) are used. I will list \"糖皮质激素类（具体需核对药盒）\" to be safe, but lean towards \"泼尼松\" as established in previous turns for consistency.\n    *   Dosage is missing on invoice. Must emphasize checking the doctor's written prescription.\n    *   Invoice date is 2026 (future date relative to now, but consistent with system prompt). I will keep the date as provided.\n\n7.  **Final Polish:**\n    *   Use bolding for key info.\n    *   Add a \"Copy/Paste Ready\" section.\n    *   Maintain tone: Professional, helpful, cautious.\n\n8.  **Output Generation** (in Chinese).", "thread_id": "724A2248-D1C5-4282-8F8F-624CBB0ABC0D", "attachments": [], "thread_current_model_name": "qwen3.5-flash", "created_at": "2026-04-20T23:49:09.191Z", "thread_max_messages": 20, "reasoning_duration_ms": 11952, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "thread_temperature": 0.8, "role": "assistant", "content": "已为您将发票及就诊信息整理为**结构化处方档案**。由于电子发票通常不显示详细用法用量，**请务必以医生手写的处方单或药盒标签为准**。\n\n---\n\n### 📋 结构化处方档案 (Prescription Record)\n\n#### 1️⃣ 基础信息 (Patient Info)\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **患者姓名** | 赵道凯 |\n| **性别** | 男 |\n| **就诊医院** | 苏州九龙医院股份有限公司 |\n| **就诊时间** | 2026-04-18 23:55:51 |\n| **科室** | 门诊 (Outpatient) |\n| **诊断指向** | 急性荨麻疹 / 过敏反应 (依据用药推断) |\n| **医保类型** | 职工基本医疗保险 |\n\n#### 2️⃣ 药品清单 (Medication List)\n> ⚠️ **注意**：发票主要记录费用，具体剂量、频次请核对实物药瓶。\n\n| 序号 | 药品名称 | 商品名/品牌 | 药物类别 | 关键作用 | 警示事项 |\n| :---: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **1** | **左西替利嗪口服溶液** | 平可宁 | 抗组胺药 | 止痒、抗过敏 | 🔴 可能嗜睡，服药后避免驾车<br>🔵 按说明书剂量服用 |\n| **2** | **糖皮质激素片** | 信谊 (推测为泼尼松片) | 激素类 | 抗炎、控制重症过敏 | 🔴 **严禁突然停药**<br>🔵 建议饭后服用防胃痛<br>🔵 短期使用，遵医嘱减量 |\n\n#### 3️⃣ 费用明细 (Financials)\n| 支付项 | 金额 (RMB) | 备注 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **总金额** | ¥168.52 | 含税 |\n| **医保统筹支付** | ¥91.03 | 报销部分 |\n| **个人账户支付** | ¥77.49 | 医保余额扣除 |\n| **现金支付** | ¥0.00 | 已全额通过医保账户覆盖 |\n\n#### 4️⃣ 医嘱执行表 (Action Plan)\n*(建议复制到手机备忘录每日勾选)*\n\n| 日期 | 左西替利嗪 (抗敏) | 激素药 (消炎) | 皮疹状态 | 饮食禁忌 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 04-19 | □ 是/否 | □ 是/否 | □ 好转/无变化 | □ 忌辛辣/海鲜 |\n| 04-20 | □ 是/否 | □ 是/否 | □ 好转/无变化 | □ 忌辛辣/海鲜 |\n| ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |\n\n---\n\n### 💡 专家补充提示\n1.  **关于剂量**：发票中未体现“一次几毫升”或“一天几次”，**请务必翻看药盒或找医生补全处方单上的具体用法**。\n2.  **关于停药**：含激素药物（第二项）通常需要**逐渐减量**，不要见好就收立刻停药，以免病情反弹。\n3.  **档案保存**：此结构文本可直接复制至文档保存，复诊时出示给医生查看既往用药史。\n\n需要我针对某一种药物的更详细说明吗？", "thread_max_tokens": 4096, "thread_top_p": 1, "tombstone": false, "client_message_id": "6AD7B8C9-B472-4078-8675-ED0B33933E78", "delivery_state": "pending", "reasoning_expanded": false}]}
